  "id": "transformational-leadership",
  "term": "transformational leadership",
  "definition": "Transformational leadership is a leadership style in which leaders inspire and influence followers by earning trust and respect, giving work a strong sense of meaning, encouraging new ways of thinking, and supporting each person’s development. It emphasizes motivation, creativity, shared values, and individualized guidance to help people grow and perform well.",
